cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "WARN Feed: US WARN Act layoff notices, normalized and daily-updated"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "WARN Feed"
    website: "https://approj.github.io/warn-act-notices/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/APProj/warn-act-notices"
url: "https://approj.github.io/warn-act-notices/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - WARN Act
  - layoff notices
  - layoffs
  - labor market
  - workforce data
  - economic data
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Deduplicated, schema-normalized dataset of US WARN Act layoff notices
  collected from official state labor department listings across 29 states,
  refreshed daily. Free tier covers 2024-present with a 48-hour delay; fields
  include employer (raw and canonicalized), location, employees affected,
  notice and effective dates, and notice type. Collection builds on the
  Apache-2.0 biglocalnews/warn-scraper (Stanford Big Local News) plus an
  independent normalization, dedup and employer-canonicalization layer.
